      "id": "5949c126-658a-4cf0-a406-d6664669fd22",
      "body": "Confirmed: the flare_forecast config uses the standard order `[aia94, aia131, aia171, aia193, aia211, aia304, aia335, aia1600, hmi_m, hmi_bx, hmi_by, hmi_bz, hmi_v]`, so **index 0 is aia94, and aia131 is index 1**. That's why your plot didn't look like HMI \u2014 it wasn't HMI at all, it was AIA 94.\n\nSince you actually want AIA 131 (not HMI), just change the two `0` indices to `1`:",
