      "body": "i need to understand how to check whether it flips or not in a way that won't go through my memory immediately--is there a good way to edit portion of the notebook where im doing the check?\n\nfor i in range(3):\n    sample = train_dataset.__getitem__(0)\n    print(f\"call {i}: was_flipped={sample['was_flipped']}\")"
